states in the Bloch sphere that may be useful for using the Plutchik model of emotions, for example, c.f.50. However, as seen in Fig. 2b, the Russell model is more suitable for our case since it presumes a simple visualization of DM agents interaction with various information fields, which can change the emotional states of users. This is because the purpose of our analysis in this work is both the behavior of the two-level (cognitive) systems and the information field interacting with them.
